flowchart TD
    A([Report cycle — raw sensor reads complete]) --> B[For each channel:<br/>T · RH · TVOC · lux · CO₂]

    B --> C["Ring buffer per channel<br/>buf[0..N-1]  ·  N = filter depth"]

    C --> D["buf[k] = raw reading<br/>k = sample_index mod N"]

    D --> E[sample_index++<br/>wrap at N]

    E --> F{samples stored >= N?}

    F -->|No — warming up| G[Use partial mean over stored count<br/>or defer TX until N reached]
    F -->|Yes| H["filtered = (buf[0] + … + buf[N-1]) / N<br/>arithmetic mean per channel"]

    G --> I[Copy filtered values to report struct]
    H --> I

    I --> J{LoRa report due?}
    J -->|Yes| K[Pack 19-byte payload<br/>filtered T · RH · TVOC · lux · CO₂]
    J -->|No| L([Wait next sample cycle])
    K --> M[LoRa TX]
    M --> L

    subgraph cfg [Typical configuration]
        N1["N = 3 — faster response, less smoothing"]
        N2["N = 5 — default balance"]
        N3["N configurable in firmware<br/>no extra sensor reads or energy"]
    end

    style H fill:#9fc5e8,color:#000
    style D fill:#9fc5e8,color:#000
    style I fill:#9fc5e8,color:#000
    style cfg fill:#f5f5f5,color:#000
